{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわ(((っ･ω･)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイトルの『は』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近自分の歯がポロポロ\n抜けていく(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていう夢をよくみる\n真夏です(´-ω-｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"びっくりした？？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夢だよ夢～｀‐ω‐´)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日握手会に来てくださる方は\nちゃんと真夏の歯があるか\n確かめに来てください(ﾉ･v･)ﾉ♡←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"起きると歯があって\nすっごい安心するの（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/04/13/4877249/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ストートヘアーヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校には まなツイン は\nしていきません/(｡･ω･｡)\\"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて♪\n毎日プリンシパル公演の\n稽古に取り組んでます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで役を交代交代に\n演じながら練習をしてるのですが\nすごく楽しいです∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分とは性格の異なった\n役を演じるのはとても新鮮で\nワクワクしますヽ(｡･ω･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一ヶ月後！素敵なものを\nみなさんにみていただけるように\nみんなで頑張りますΣ(σ`･ω･´)σ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/04/13/4877249/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近真夏のお家でたまに\nれなりんが話題にあがるの（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おしっ♪\n明日は名古屋で個握だね∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうテンションが\n上がっておりますヽ(〃v〃)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってみなさんに\n会えるんだもんっ♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、選抜発表のこと聞いて\nきてもまだ内緒だからね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聞いちゃダメよー(*`･ω･´)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば一個前のブログ\n選抜発表の日にちを\n一ヶ月間違ってましたね(ﾟ-ﾟ；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんのコメントで\n気づいた(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなったんとおしゃべり\ntime(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ♡いきまする♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qまなつは何団子が１番好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aやっぱり定番のみたらし♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お団子ではないんだけど\n岩手の親戚のお家に行くと\nよく、くるみ餅っていうのを\n出してもらっててそれが\nすごくお気に入りなの∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれは岩手県のご当地もの\nなのかなぁ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"岩手の方知ってますか？(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qひなちまは中学の同級生に『ひなちま』というあだ名をつけてもらったらしいのですが、真夏さんの『まなったん』は誰が名付け親なのかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A私も中高の同級生に\nつけてもらったよ(((っ･ω･)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ディズニーランドにみんなで\n行っててアトラクションに\n並んでる時になぜか『真夏の\nあだ名と自己紹介はどうするか』\nっていう話になって（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q好きな四季は？\n理由と共に！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aやっぱり夏かな∩^ω^∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日も夏休みもあるし♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逆にみなさんは\nどの季節が好き～？？♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...空気を読んでくださいね？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は何かを期待してますよ...(-ω-ﾒ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qいつもどうやって、ブログのタイトル決めてるんですか？？(^o^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Aその時のノリです♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ノリだからたまに\n効果音みたいなタイトルの\nときもあるのヽ(｡･ω･)ﾉﾞ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゅっちゅるちゅーとか♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もし明日の握手会で\n初めて来てくださる方や\n緊張しいな方などなど\n何話そうって思ったときには"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『今ハマっているもの』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"を聞いてみてください♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビンに入った○○ですヽ(｡･∀･)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日来られない方には\nまたブログで答え言うね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぶぉーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2013/04/13/4877249/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月のぱっつんが\n似合いすぎてて\nかわいすぎる_(┐「ε:)_"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ので..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月のブログの写メを\n保存してしまいました///♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本人には内緒だよヾ(-ω-*)"}],"source":"archive"}